{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15246","headline":"长干行 · 李益","name":"长干行","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"忆妾深闺里，烟尘不曾识。\n嫁与长干人，沙头候风色。\n五月南风兴，思君下巴陵。\n八月西风起，想君发扬子。\n去来悲如何，见少离别多。\n湘潭几日到，妾梦越风波。\n昨夜狂风度，吹折江头树。\n渺渺暗无边，行人在何处。\n好乘浮云骢，佳期兰渚东。\n鸳鸯绿浦上，翡翠锦屏中。\n自怜十五余，颜色桃花红。\n那作商人妇，愁水复愁风。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李益","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_15246.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_15246","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}